      { cite: "Faunal (pig bone) analyses at Iron I sites", url: null, where: "Zooarchaeological studies by Brian Hesse and Paula Wapnish on pig use in the southern Levant, discussed in most handbooks of Israelite archaeology, e.g. the relevant chapters of Finkelstein and Silberman, The Bible Unearthed (Free Press, 2001)." },
      { cite: "Avraham Faust, 'Israel's Ethnogenesis'", url: null, where: "Avraham Faust, Israel's Ethnogenesis: Settlement, Interaction, Expansion and Resistance (Equinox, 2006); academic libraries and standard bibliographies of Iron Age I." }
