      { cite: "Khirbet Qeiyafa excavations (Yosef Garfinkel)", url: "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khirbet_Qeiyafa", where: "Wikipedia overview of the site and the debate; excavation reports published by Garfinkel and colleagues through the Israel Exploration Society." }
